referenceFunction.generalComment:
The functional unit represent 1 kg of anhydrous trimethylamine.  Trimethylamine is produced commercially together with di-methylamine and mono-methylamine. Due to the stoechiometric calculation of the data in this inventory only trimethylamine was considerd as product. Large uncertainty on the process emissions due to missing data.;
CAS number: 000075-50-3; 
Formula: C3H9N; 
Synonyms: TMA, N,N-dimethylmethamine, N,N-dimethylmethanamine; 
UUID: ebd9b242-5561-3dd9-9ac8-e3e4d7e0315a
